---
description: Pin compatible CI and Helm dependencies when updating deployment configuration
globs:
  - "**/.gitlab-ci.yml"
  - "**/chart/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

# CI and chart versions

When a pipeline includes a shared template, select a release compatible with the service's chart. Keep environment-specific values in the project that owns the deployment. Change only the values required by the upgrade.

Replace each bracketed field with the CI project, include file and release selected for this deployment.

```yaml
include:
  - project: "<ci-template-project>"
    file: "<pipeline-file>"
    ref: "<compatible-release>"
```
